# System Core — PHP 8.5 Rules

`system/` is CodeIgniter **3.1.13**. Already includes `PHP8SessionWrapper.php`.

## Subagent First

Use `explore` subagent to scan `system/` for PHP 8.5 issues before editing. Use `shell` subagent to run PHP and verify bootstrap/session after changes.

## Allowed Changes

- PHP 8.5 compat fixes in `system/core/`, `system/libraries/Session/`
- Null coalescing, type hints, deprecated function replacements
- `system/core/compat/` polyfills if needed

## Not Allowed

- Upgrading to CodeIgniter 4
- Changing Router, URI, or bootstrap flow
- Modifying database drivers unless mysqli errors on PHP 8.5
- Refactoring unrelated system files

## After Any system/ Change

Test: login/session, database connect, form submit, file upload, one PDF export.
